Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯企业微信AI智能助理“大圆”开启内测，支持一键总结群聊与生成周报</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">04</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">腾讯QQ宠物接入混元Hy3大模型实现3D化升级并正式回归</span></section></section><section style=\"display:flex;margin-bottom:16px;align-items:baseline;\"><section style=\"flex-shrink:0;width:36px;text-align:left;\"><span style=\"font-size:24px;font-weight:900;color:rgb(92,11,214);font-family:Arial,sans-serif;font-style:italic;line-height:1;\">05</span></section><section style=\"flex-grow:1;\"><span style=\"font-size:16px;font-weight:700;color:#1f1f1f;letter-spacing:.5px;line-height:1.6;text-align:justify;font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Helvetica Neue','PingFang SC','Microsoft YaHei',sans-serif;\">美团发布全场景AI Agent平台CatPaw，搭载1.6T参数开源大模型LongCat 2.0</span></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:10px auto;text-align:center;\"><section style=\"display:inline-block;\"><section style=\"margin-top:-4px;padding:0 40px;outline:0;font-size:24px;letter-spacing:1.5px;\"><strong><span leaf=\"\">新闻速览</span></strong></section><section style=\"margin-top:-2px;width:182px;height:2px;background-color:rgb(58,19,228);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"margin-top:3px;width:182px;height:1px;background-color:rgb(111,19,209);overflow:hidden;\"><span leaf=\"\"><br></span></section><section style=\"outline:0;font-size:12px;letter-spacing:1.5px;color:rgb(92,11,214);transform:scale(.9);\"><span leaf=\"\">NEWS GLANCE</span></section></section></section><section id=\"xiangqing\"><section id=\"content1\"><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">谷歌CEO皮查伊确认下一代前沿模型Gemini 4已正式投入训练</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/5660ecce34ff1d5cc899ef55ac4fa9a7.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">谷歌CEO桑达尔·皮查伊在2026年第二季度财报电话会议上正式确认，下一代前沿模型Gemini 4已投入训练，谷歌为此投入了极大规模的计算资源。按照过往发布节奏，外界预计该模型有望于今年11月或12月正式亮相。面对分析师关于行业竞争的提问，皮查伊坦言谷歌在编程和智能体（Agent）领域仍存在短板，目前团队正高度聚焦这些关键方向。Gemini 4被视为谷歌缩小技术差距、重回行业领先地位的关键一役。皮查伊对目前的训练进展表示欣喜，并强调该模型将通过提升用户体验来回应市场关切。随着Anthropic的Claude系列在编程赛道持续领先以及OpenAI的加速迭代，Gemini 4的发布将成为2026年AI大模型领域的收官之战，其性能表现将直接决定谷歌在模型迭代竞争中的话语权。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">蚂蚁百灵发布新一代原生混合推理模型Ling-3.0-Flash</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/4ee58b827e9b7c6b82d5c832d4dd7a43.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">蚂蚁百灵于7月24日正式发布新一代原生混合推理模型Ling-3.0-Flash。该模型总参数量124B，单次计算激活5.1B，通过底层架构创新实现高“智效比”。技术上，模型采用混合注意力架构，以5:1比例交替堆叠KDA线性注意力层与MLA层，并将Lightning Attention升级为KDA，引入细粒度对角门控以提升长文档记忆精度。此外，每个Token的专家激活比例压缩至1/64，显著降低算力开销。针对Agent场景，Ling-3.0-Flash扩展了超10000个真实交互训练环境，优化了自我纠错与长程规划机制。工程侧引入集群级分级缓存，使长输入首字响应延迟降低60%至80%以上，并配套多智能体协同架构以提升任务稳定性。该模型已上线OpenRouter并限时免费一周，后续将正式开源，旨在为高频线上服务与复杂</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯企业微信AI智能助理“大圆”开启内测，支持一键总结群聊与生成周报</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/da65f8f40dada1304b0626c3d5b487b9.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯正式开启企业微信AI智能助理“大圆”的内测。该助理深度集成于企业微信生态，手机端通过侧边把手左滑唤起，电脑端则位于左侧边栏，无需切换应用即可使用。在核心功能方面，“大圆”具备“爬楼”能力，能自动提炼99+未读消息重点、总结语音内容并生成待办事项。在办公自动化场景下，它可调用智能文档、表格、会议及日程等数十项原生能力。用户仅需输入指令，系统即可自动检索历史消息、文档与邮件，梳理项目进展并生成周报初稿。此次更新标志着企业微信从通讯协作工具向AI驱动的智能办公中枢转型，通过减少跨应用切换摩擦，旨在提升企业内部信息处理效率与工作流自动化水平。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">腾讯QQ宠物接入混元Hy3大模型实现3D化升级并正式回归</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1633c01849890a99f5e57ea0e4ab94bf.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">腾讯宣布QQ宠物正式回归，此次升级不仅实现形象全面3D化，更深度接入腾讯自研的混元Hy3大模型，赋予虚拟宠物主动回应能力。Hy3模型于7月6日开源，采用MoE混合专家架构，总参数量达2950亿，激活参数210亿，支持256K上下文长度，在推理与智能体任务上表现优异。在玩法上，QQ宠物保留喂食、洗澡、打工等经典机制，并新增性格设定与社交互动功能，宠物将直接嵌入QQ聊天列表与对话框场景。此次更新将顶级AI能力引入亿级用户日常，用户可体验更具沉浸感的养成乐趣，甚至将宠物培养为当红巨星。这一举措标志着QQ宠物从怀旧符号转型为AI驱动的智能陪伴产品，通过大模型技术重构虚拟社交体验。</section></section><section data-mpa-template=\"t\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:40px 0 32px;outline:0;color:rgb(22,1,110);font-family:'PingFang SC';letter-spacing:.5px;font-size:16px;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:10px 0 20px;outline:0;text-align:left;display:flex;flex-flow:row nowrap;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"padding-left:5px;outline:0;display:inline-block;width:auto;vertical-align:top;border-left:5px solid rgb(45,5,147);flex:100 100 0%;align-self:flex-start;\"><section powered-by=\"xiumi.us\" mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"margin:-2px 0 -3px;outline:0;\"><section mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" style=\"outline:0;font-size:17px;line-height:1.3;text-align:justify;\"><p style=\"outline:0;\"><strong mpa-from-tpl=\"t\" mpa-is-content=\"t\" style=\"text-align:left;outline:0;\"><span leaf=\"\">美团发布全场景AI Agent平台CatPaw，搭载1.6T参数开源大模型LongCat 2.0</span></strong></p></section></section></section></section><section style=\"margin:16px 0;text-align:center;\"><img class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" style=\"max-width:100%;border-radius:8px;\" src=\"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/duguBoss/daily-tech-hub/main/assets/news_images/1daff02cd0d755b60a94712c7bb7df70.jpg\"></section><section style=\"color:#333;line-height:1.8;font-size:15px;text-align:justify;\">7月27日，美团正式上线全场景AI Agent平台CatPaw，该平台搭载了本月开源的1.6T参数大模型LongCat 2.0。LongCat 2.0原生支持1M超长上下文，是首个在五万张国产算力卡上完成全流程训练与推理的万亿参数模型。CatPaw平台将底层算力转化为企业级智能工作台，深度融入美团本地生活全链路认知，针对门店经营、营销转化及履约配送等场景封装了专家技能。该平台支持跨会话长期记忆、自主规划执行及多Agent协同，并提供百毫秒级冷启动与动态扩缩容的工程底座。目前，CatPaw已在美团内部覆盖9万名员工，搭建Agent超3万个。此次发布标志着美团实现了从自研大模型到全场景AI应用的贯通，为本地生活产业的智能化升级提供了规模化落地范式。</section></section></section></section><section style=\"text-align:center;\"><img data-src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\" class=\"rich_pages wxw-img\" data-ratio=\"0.4255555555555556\" data-type=\"png\" data-w=\"900\" src=\"https://mmbiz.qpic.cn/mmbiz_png/xm1dT1jCe8lWwznuFM0USlcQ4HAb5iapyGyBVUyRZOyLbF3SaPphbdlF7K9R7YLicicIjdeAPueYcKHJDZEiceeUFQ/640?wx_fmt=png\"></section>",
